## Conventions

- Every page is Markdown with YAML frontmatter; `type` is required. Recommended keys: `title`, `description`
  (reused verbatim in `index.md`), `tags`, `status` (`draft`, `stable`, `deprecated`), `stale_after`.
- Links between pages are relative Markdown links. File names are kebab-case.
- Provenance: every weight-bearing claim carries a footnote keyed to a `sources[].id` of the page; the id
  resolves to a page in `sources/`, then to the extraction and the original. A claim that cannot be traced is
  marked as such. Nothing is invented: not a citation, not a figure, not a sign-off.
- A page that is superseded is marked `status: deprecated`; it is not deleted.
- `index.md` lists every page; `log.md` records changes, newest first.

